@startuml worker_architecture
!pragma layout smetana

title The architecture of the projection worker Workspace

hide footbox
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #334155
    LifeLineBorderColor #334155
    ParticipantBorderColor #2563EB
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #EFF6FF
}

actor "The client ." as Client
participant "REST / RestAlchemy\nThe controller ." as API
database "The original tables\ncanonical entities + connections + facts" as SOURCE
database "Unchanged domain\noutbox" as OUTBOX
participant "Task projector\n1 task I 'm on outbox event" as PROJECTOR
database "Typed tasks\nProjections" as TASKS
participant "A custom worker pool\n0..N active slots" as POOL
database "Rented exact scope key\nlease + fencing token" as CLAIM
participant "The worker's slot." as WORKER
database "Ready projections\n+ links + status / photos" as READY
database "The public events repository" as EVENTS
participant "The controller . WebSocket\nRepeat + play" as DISPATCHER
actor "The client . WebSocket" as WS

Client -> API : A request that changes the state
activate API
API -> SOURCE : Change the lines  truth sources
API -> OUTBOX : Add a non-changing event\nin the same transaction
API --> Client : The fixed immediate response
deactivate API

note over API,OUTBOX
  POST Creates messages in sync:
  MESSAGE + MESSAGE_PLACEMENT
  + The author 's USER_MESSAGE_BINDING
  + USER_MESSAGE_STATE + outbox.
  The binding + the receiver state are created together through fanout.
end note

OUTBOX -> PROJECTOR : The events that have been recorded
PROJECTOR -> TASKS : immutable task(outbox_event_uuid, kind, scope)\nunique derivation; without coalescing
TASKS -> POOL : Waiting for a job\n(without searching for missing lines)
POOL -> CLAIM : I 'm gonna get the right one . scope key
CLAIM --> POOL : monopoly lease/ownership
POOL -> WORKER : Set the limit within the limit set N
activate WORKER
WORKER -> SOURCE : Read the last recorded state
note right of WORKER
  Only for scope=topic:
  MESSAGE.created_at DESC
  14:20 -> 14:19 -> 14:15
  fanout batch: user_uuid ASC, default 1000, max 5000
  After batch — checkpoint and bounded fairness
end note
group One . DB transaction
  WORKER -> READY : I 'm a powerhouse . materialization / batch upsert
  WORKER -> EVENTS : durable ready rows; unique derivation key
end
WORKER -> CLAIM : I 'm gonna get you out of here .
deactivate WORKER

EVENTS -> DISPATCHER : - I 'm not sure .
DISPATCHER -> WS : Send / repeat / play
note over EVENTS,WS
  Reconnect: cursor + high-watermark + replay + buffer/drain without gap.
  At-least-once; client dedupe The event UUID.
  Membership generation It 's suppressing . data events After revoke.
end note

note over SOURCE,READY
  Public links UUID are scalar UUID-The properties.
  Physical columns *_uuid remain indexed external keys.
  Container aggregates are stored in unique bindings
  user to the container, but not in message bindings.
  MESSAGE_PLACEMENT.uuid — public UUID The message.
  MESSAGE.uuid — The internal canonical content UUID;
  UUID USER_MESSAGE_BINDING It 's still hidden . row identity.
  FOLDER It 's only kept once .; normalized FOLDER_ITEM = source of truth.
  USER_FOLDER_BINDING It keeps access, meters and read-only JSONB
  folder_items_snapshot (empty=[]), version/updated_at.
  Automatically read active folders USER_STREAM_BINDING + STREAM.is_archived=false:
  All chats = All of them .; Personal = STREAM.private=true; Channels = STREAM.private=false.
end note

note over TASKS,READY
  Ownership routing:
  fanout/placement state -> topic(project, topic)
  reaction snapshot -> message(project, canonical message)
  stream aggregates -> user-stream(project, user, stream)
  folder_projection -> user-folder(project, user, folder)
  topic aggregates -> user-topic(project, user, topic)
  Other shared rows They demand a clear scope; fallback I 'm on topic It 's forbidden ..
  Topic-worker Does not perform unsafe read-modify-write shared rows.
  folder_projection He writes snapshot + counts + version/time
  + All of them . ready events In one worker DB transaction.
  API He 's reading one . indexed row/page without N+1/json_agg/COUNT/custom SQL.
end note

note over PROJECTOR,CLAIM
  Lifecycle: pending -> leased/running -> completed/failed -> DLQ.
  Lease expiry, attempts/backoff, max attempts, reaper/reconciliation.
  Atomic counter delta Only allowed with exactly-once effect guard
  The outbox_event_uuid; Otherwise scope worker recomputes/writes.
end note

note over API,OUTBOX
  GET/The list ends after the indexed reading
  And does not create. outbox/The task.
end note

@enduml
